  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **+Richard Petty** (1 other source): The band played it acapella and unplugged at the front of the stage, around a single can microphone [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Malfnction Junction**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- ***Give The Fiddler A Dram**: rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- ***Whistling Rufus**: rare: 6 archived performances [3]\n- ***Ragtime Annie**: rare: 5 archived performances [3]\n- **#@^Clinch Mountain Backstep**: rare: 11 archived performances [3]\n- **#@^Shine Your Blues**: mythic rare: 2 archived performances [3]\n- **#@^White Freight Liner Blues**: rare: 13 archived performances [3]\n- **#@^Blues Stay Away From Me**: rare: 8 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **billystrings2024-10-19.Z** (recommended): source not stated; 32 songs; 162 min [1]\n- **billystrings2024-10-19.BS2024-10-19_41VXY90-22NOS_4MinX_MixPre_24bx48khzflac**: source not stated; 30 songs; 160 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Vince Herman joined on guitar and vocals, Drew Emmitt on mandolin and vocals, and Andy Thorn on banjo and vocals, for different segments [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **billystrings2024-10-19.Z**: taped by Z-Man; transferred by Z-Man; source: Schoeps CCM4V'S>Sound Devices Mix-Pre 6 II (48/32) [1]. Also: Recorded with Schoeps CCM4V microphones into a Sound Devices MixPre-6 II at 48kHz/32-bit, from the stage, eight feet high [1]\n- **billystrings2024-10-19.BS2024-10-19_41VXY90-22NOS_4MinX_MixPre_24bx48khzflac**: taped by TNTaper; transferred by Taped, tracked, seeded by Uncle Terry Thomas (tntaper); source: Schoeps_Mk41VXY90>VST62IU+Mk22NOS>CMC6>AETA_4MinX>MixPre-6II_32b/96khz [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @swaycout: [Billy Strings The Orion Amphitheater Huntsville AL Oct 19 2024 Poster](https://swaycout.com/billy-strings-the-orion-amphitheater-huntsville-al-oct-19-2024-poster/) [4]",
